//! | NOEFF    | warning  | no  | Statement has no effect (expression result discarded)             |
//! | EQEFF    | warning  | no  | Comparison has no effect (result not used)                        |
//! | ASGLU    | warning  | no  | Assignment to a variable that is immediately overwritten          |
